  "body": "Enjoy modern comfort and easy family living in this brand-new, four-bedroom home. With CCC now issued, this is an exciting opportunity to secure your next home in the sought-after Macleans College zone.\r\nThe practical two-level layout features a modern kitchen and dining area, a separate lounge, and a timber deck ideal for relaxing or entertaining. Upstairs, four bedrooms and two bathrooms provide space for the family, while a downstairs guest toilet adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n\r\n* Four bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms\r\n* Modern kitchen and dining area\r\n* Separate lounge opening onto a timber deck\r\n* Internal-access single garage with laundry\r\n* Under-stair storage\r\n* Zoned for Macleans College\r\n* CCC issued\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Half Moon Bay Lifestyle\r\nExplore the marina, meet friends at local cafés or take advantage of ferry connections from Half Moon Bay. Nearby beaches, parks, shops and everyday amenities add to the appeal of this popular East Auckland location.\r\nMake your next move to Half Moon Bay and enjoy a fresh start in a brand-new home.\r\n\r\nContact us to arrange your viewing.",
